THE ASSEMBLY, now that the route is written: `heckeEndo N q ^ k` lies in
`𝕋` (`pow_mem` on `heckeEndo_mem_heckeSubring`), so its trace is a
rational integer by `exists_trace_heckeSubring_int`; that makes the
