            (Fact.out : ℓ.Prime))).Space),
      Function.Injective ι ∧
      ∀ (g : Field.absoluteGaloisGroup
          (HeightOneSpectrum.adicCompletion ℚ
            (Nat.Prime.toHeightOneSpectrumRingOfIntegersRat
              (Fact.out : ℓ.Prime))))
        (x : ((ρT.baseChange (T ⧸ I)).toLocal
          (Nat.Prime.toHeightOneSpectrumRingOfIntegersRat
            (Fact.out : ℓ.Prime))).Space),
