conjugate by one fixed `c ∈ Γ ℚ`, elementwise onto. Proof (the at-`2`
template, with the conjugator hoisted out of the element quantifier):
the continuous `ℚ`-algebra isomorphism `adicCompletion ℚ v_p ≃ ℚ_[p]`
