generated by Frobenius. Nothing about `gaussSum` valuations exists in
mathlib (`Mathlib/NumberTheory/GaussSum.lean` has only
`gaussSum_mul_gaussSum_eq_card` and `gaussSum_sq`), nor in `~/cs/FLT` —
