**THE CUT, along the `p = 2` / `p` odd axis the faithfulness note below
already forced.** The two cases are genuinely disjoint and neither implies
the other:

* `p = 2`: `CF = ℚ(μ_2) = ℚ`, `Module.finrank ℚ CF = Nat.totient 2 = 1`,
