/-- **THE `ℓ`-PRIMARY HILBERT CLASS FIELD: for every prime `ℓ`, `ℚ(μ_p)`
has a finite ABELIAN extension, unramified at every finite place, whose
degree is divisible by the `ℓ`-part of `h_K`** (SORRY LEAF, cut 2026-07-28
