/-- **THE EXISTENCE HALF: an everywhere-unramified abelian extension of
`ℚ(μ_p)` of degree EXACTLY the class number** (E3c support leaf
(ii-a-1-i-B-1); SORRY NODE, cut 2026-07-27 out of
