polynomial `P`).  It is NOT needed to exclude `X = ∅`: the empty curve has
`L = Σ_s (q^s + 1)T^s = −T·P′/P` for `P = (1 − T)(1 − qT)`, which is a perfectly
good witness here — that is the `γ = (q, 1)` of the parent's docstring.

