`∃ a b, ∃ K ⊴ Γℚ of finite index, ∀ γ ∈ K, δ₁ γ · χ_cyc(γ)^b =
χ_cyc(γ)^a` — i.e. `δ₁ = χ_cyc^{a−b}` **exactly**, on a subgroup of
