`p ^ n`-th power and use per-level radicality at BOTH levels:

    q = u (n + 1) ^ p ^ (n + 1) = (u n · q ^ z) ^ p ^ n = q · q ^ (z · p ^ n),

so `q ^ (z · p ^ n) = 1`, so `z · p ^ n = 0` by `v(q) < 1`
