prime-to-`p` Artin conductor of the geometric attachment `ρ_{g,λ}` as
the level: `ord_r (cond ρ_{g,λ}) = ord_r M` at every prime `r ≠ p`, in
particular `a₂ = ord₂ M` (here `2 ≠ p` because `p` is odd, `hpodd`).
