  so `P₂` acts trivially and the Swan conductor `Sw₂(V)` — a sum over
  the nontrivial higher ramification breaks, all of which live in the
  wild part — vanishes;
* hence `a₂ = (2 − dim V^{I₂}) + Sw₂ ≤ 1 + 0 = 1`, and Carayol's
  `ord₂ M = a₂` gives `M.factorization 2 ≤ 1`.

